At eight o'clock, I set off.
I leave my flat.
I lock the door.
Then I walk quickly to the U-Bahn station.
I walk down the stairs.
The U-Bahn is already standing at the platform.
I run quickly.
I am almost there.
But the doors close.
The U-Bahn departs.
I stand on the platform.
I sigh loudly.
That is annoying.
I look at my mobile phone.
The next U-Bahn comes in ten minutes.
So I wait.
Ten minutes are luckily not long.
